  "derivation": "From the far end: R6 || R7 = 2k || 2k = 1k, plus R5 = 2k; in parallel with R4 = 1k, plus R3 = 2k; in parallel with R2 = 1k, plus R1 = 2k total. I(R1) = 8/2k = 4 mA, so n1 = 8 - 4 = 4 V. Each stage splits the current equally, so n2 = 2 V and n3 = 1 V.",
